Selkies web client: a slower touchpad mode

Against Selkies 2.1.0. Acceleration is capped at 1.5x instead of 3x and speeds go down to 0.1; the
stock touchpad mode is far too fast. Upstream's touch gesture audit checks both. For upstream.
-----

